<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101373" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συσκοτ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make dark</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄστρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ez.</u>
					32.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέραν εἰς νύκτα ς</span>.
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Am.</u>
				5.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>grow quite dark</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ οὐρανὸς ς.
				νεφέλαις</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				18.45
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Jl.</u>
				3.15
			</span></i>, al.:—but, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in early writers, always impers., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυσκοτάζει</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ
			θεός</span>) <i>it grows dark</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.73
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.15
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤδη συσκοτάζοντος</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ θεοῦ</span>) <i>when it
			was</i> now <i>getting dark</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				75.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				141
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συσκοτάζοντος ἄρτι τοῦ θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					31.13.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
